stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  accTitle: 3C lifecycle: one issue through /3c-project-manager
  accDescr: An issue passes a scope and reachability pre-check, a plan and a confirmed branch, a failing test, the minimum code, a commit through the hook chain, /3c-review, the verify gate and the review board. A clean or advisory verdict opens a PR that a person confirms and merges, then a handover issue is filed. A blocking verdict gets one fix cycle; if it is still blocking, the issue goes back to a person.

  state "Issue" as Issue
  state "Scope and reachability pre-check" as PreCheck
  state "Branch" as Branch
  state "RED: a failing test" as Red
  state "GREEN: the minimum code" as Green
  state "Commit" as Commit
  state "/3c-review" as Review
  state "Verify gate" as Verify
  state "Review board" as Board
  state "One fix cycle, then the board again" as Fix
  state "PR, confirmed by a person" as PR
  state "Handover issue filed" as Handover
  state "Back to a person" as Stopped

  [*] --> Issue: /3c-create-issue
  Issue --> PreCheck: /3c-project-manager
  PreCheck --> Stopped: unclear or unreachable
  PreCheck --> Branch: plan shown, a person confirms
  Branch --> Red: /3c-test
  Red --> Green
  Green --> Commit: guards falsified
  Commit --> Green: the hook chain fails
  Commit --> Review
  Review --> Red: critical or major
  Review --> Verify: clean, or override and continue: draft PR
  Verify --> Red: a non-zero exit
  Verify --> Board: passes, output quoted
  Board --> PR: clean or advisory
  Board --> Fix: blocking
  Fix --> PR: clean or advisory
  Fix --> Stopped: still blocking
  PR --> Handover: merged by a person
  Handover --> [*]: optional /3c-retrospective
  Stopped --> [*]
